        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "This company is amazing! They moved a friend of mine from one residence to another about two years ago and I am sorry I am writing this only now. They took care of everything with such care and respect for her belongings but herself as well. We never touched a box or paper and they put everything back in place as if my friend had always lived in that apartment, taking time to even maximize the bathroom space as it was much smaller than the previous one. They helped choose where to hang up pictures and made sure her chair was the first thing in her apartment (with her shawls on it!) so that she could be comfortable right away and not get too tired. This year, I even called them to help with a disastrous move (we thought we couldn't use them, big misunderstanding! Wished we had called them instead) and they found a way to help us on the same day I emailed them!! I can't say enough good things about their team and service. I am very grateful for the peace of mind they provide and for their kindness.",
